      "body": "Fix the MiMo-V2 target model's attention sink bias load. `load_weights` slices the checkpoint tensor for the local TP rank, then uses the same current parameter loader path as other weights.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe MTP model already follows this contract and is unchanged. This PR changes only `mimo_v2.py`.\r\r\n\r\r\n## Validation\r\r\n\r\r\n- `ruff check`, `ruff format --check`, and `git diff --check` pass.\r\r\n- The integrated static audit finds no direct checkpoint sink copy. The new runtime tests have not been executed, as requested.\r\r\n\r\r\n## AI assistance\r\r\n\r\r\nAI assistance was used.\r\r\n",
